  <BodyLocalizationKey>k__BackingField: tutorial.chef_desk.body
  <Title>k__BackingField: Chef Desk
  <Body>k__BackingField: "Make sushi here.\n\nFirst, place the required ingredients on the Chef Desk. Prepared ingredients from the Prep Station should be brought in Gastro Pans, while ingredients like Rice and Nori can be added directly when needed.\n\nSelect a recipe from the recipe book, then follow the recipe steps on the table. Click the correct Gastro Pans or ingredients in order to build the sushi.\n\nWhen all steps are complete, the sushi will be plated and ready to serve."
  <VideoClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 2232a548136e62241bcd493ec3b17039, type: 3}
